<title>UK: Blue Circle Industries pretax rises 9 pct.</title>
<headline>Blue Circle Industries pretax rises 9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.5		   vs 21.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.0		    vs 8.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 13.25		  vs 12.5</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	297.6		  vs 272.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,814.8		vs 1,774.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British building industry supplier</p>
<p>is Blue Circle Industries Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
